	(text_box "TIM1_CH1 on PA8 for CLKIN is the most important pin assignment\nin this whole design. The DRV8308 uses CLKIN to synchronize \nits internal commutation timing. If you put it on a \ngeneral-purpose timer you lose center-aligned PWM alignment \nand your FOC current\n sampling will be off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
